40:**Motion findings:** motion instants — calendar entrance inside 2000–4000 (unobserved at finer grain; the panel arrives assembled with row 1 already struck) · strike sweep + ring/drop-line/label completion inside 4000–6000 · tasks-panel join inside 7000–8000 · strike continuation + tasks-row growth inside 8000–10000 · final strikes + day-34 ⊗ conversion + label-B strike + arc fade inside 10000–12000. Holds — CP6000≡CP7000 (19–20 s, the ev/020 state holds ≥1 s) · CP12000→CP13000 final state holds (only the deferred crack changes). What changes between states: strikes 7→≈20→≈26→≈32→35 in reading order (RTL rows, top first) · rings: day16 plain (4000) → ⊗ by 6000 (same cell, conversion per §1.1 (2) cure) · day34 plain (6000) → ⊗ at 12000 · drop-lines 1→2 by 6000 · label A unstruck→struck by 6000 · label B absent→present (6000) → struck (12000) · tasks panel absent→3 rows (8000) → 5 rows (10000) · arc present→gone (12000) · calendar centred→shifted left when tasks joins (8000).
